<h2>Understanding the Comparison Process</h2>

<p>
    The comparison happens in several stages:
</p>

<h3>Stage 1: Text Extraction</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Both PDFs are processed to extract all text</li>
    <li>Text is saved to cache files for future use</li>
    <li>Progress shows "Extracting Quote Text" and "Extracting Policy Text"</li>
</ul>

<h3>Stage 2: AI Analysis</h3>
<ul>
    <li>The extracted text from both documents is sent to AI for analysis</li>
    <li>AI identifies differences, changes, and important updates</li>
    <li>Progress shows "Generating Comparison"</li>
</ul>

<h3>Stage 3: Report Generation</h3>
<ul>
    <li>AI generates a formatted comparison report</li>
    <li>Report includes summary and detailed findings</li>
    <li>Results are displayed in an easy-to-read format</li>
</ul>

