<h2>Tips for Effective Comparisons</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Use clear document names</strong> – Name your policy and quote attachments clearly so they're easy to identify</li>
    <li><strong>Compare early</strong> – Run comparisons as soon as you receive renewal quotes to identify changes quickly</li>
    <li><strong>Review with context</strong> – Use the comparison report alongside the original documents for full understanding</li>
    <li><strong>Share key findings</strong> – Extract the most important changes to share with clients or underwriters</li>
    <li><strong>Save for records</strong> – Keep comparison reports as part of your renewal documentation</li>
</ul>

